      "content": "i don't really have time to go to the doctor right now with work being so crazy. honestly i feel like i just need to fix my sleep and maybe take something to help me relax. do u think like taking some melatonin or maybe an ashwagandha supplement would help clear the fog so i can focus again without needing a full checkup?",
